   "body": "Addition from the operator decision O-1 = (b) on ADR 0014 (#189, 2026-11-02): once **LOT-184** (#449, the `HFRClient` flow calling `POST /apercu.php`) is merged, this screen adds an on-demand « aperçu HFR » action that shows HFR's own rendering through the same normalizer and reader path as the local preview. No dependency between the two lots: the local preview (labelled as a preview) ships without it. The row of LOT-184 and its spec stub are in #442.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
